    "details": {
      "cr": 2,
      "type": {
        "value": "monstrosity"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>\"NINE\" (Vesk Half-made, the Unshaped) — level 3 PC pregen, Flesh-Crafted scaleweave-warped, fighting its own body. Kin to Gruffud the Writhing.</p><p><strong>Manual:</strong> resistance is acid — DM may re-pick per mutation. Writhing Lash escape DC 13 (remove the Grappled condition when the target escapes). Natural armor — AC includes warped hide.</p>"
      }
    }
  },
