    {
      "name": "Writhing Lash",
      "img": "icons/creatures/tentacles/tentacle-earth-green.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "_id": "z5jLxTjtn5dlv9nf",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The tendril acts on its own. <strong>Melee attack, reach 10 ft: 1d8+3 bludgeoning</strong> and on a hit the target is <strong>grappled</strong> (escape DC 13 — DM adjudicates; remove the condition when it escapes). At-will.</p><p><em>Manual riders: while grappling you can drag the target 5 ft. If you start your turn grappling an ALLY, DC 10 Wis save or the mutation keeps holding on.</em></p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
